    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Setup in three steps\n\n1. Open **Config** and set `base`, the CRM and calendar endpoints and the messaging sender, or swap the HTTP Request nodes for your native nodes.\n2. Point the two AI steps at your model endpoint (`base`/llm/complete) or swap them for the OpenAI or Anthropic node.\n3. Point your web form, ad platform or voice agent webhook at the Webhook URL and activate.\n\nSend one hot lead, one cool lead and one duplicate before going live.",
        "height": 300,
        "width": 560,
        "color": 7
      },
      "name": "Setup steps",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
